 "description": "Aggregate figures for a slice of the crowdfunding market: how many platforms operate there, how many are regulated and by whom, the minimum / maximum / average advertised return and minimum investment, the spread of funding volumes and founding years, and the distribution across investment types and industries. Slice it by country, industry, region or any other catalogue filter \u2014 omit them all for the whole market. Use it for \"how big / how regulated / what is typical\" questions. Do NOT use it to name platforms \u2014 it returns no platform names; search_platforms does that. Figures reflect the live catalogue at the time of the call.",
